{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":40438,\"title\":\"Kylie Minogue: KylieFever2002 - Live in Manchester\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"During the first half of 2002, Kylie Minogue toured Europe and Australia. This DVD captures it. Live In Manchester is a good concert that explores Kylie's musical catalog rather well from her days as a manufactured pop tart princess to her current status as icon and electro-pop diva. The concert occurs in seven different acts meant to display Kylie in some of the different manifestaions she has adopted throughout her career. Cultural references are everywhere in this concert. There's a nod to Keith Haring, and many others from Staney Kubrick, burlesque, and sci-fi flicks. It's all hard to catch, but done very well.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uRraSwRGCNB4Ynfew5vqBtwdOcR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gJpzGcinlmUikE93w4m01aldfCw.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":10,\"year\":2002,\"runtime\":120,\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"William Baker\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":228171,\"name\":\"William Baker\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/reREkph9CsiHcCkTeG9q3QQAaQE.jpg\"},{\"id\":15732,\"name\":\"Alan MacDonald\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":12207,\"name\":\"Kylie Minogue\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sVe6DQ1iFlk4nad0Bd3WVVVj23P.jpg\"},{\"id\":1082601,\"name\":\"Lurine Cato\",\"character\":\"Self - Backing Vocals\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hmwvNIzrojBvN7eEWr5ZB8oLTE0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1082600,\"name\":\"Sherina White\",\"character\":\"Self - Backing Vocals\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1173246,\"name\":\"Terry Kvasnik\",\"character\":\"Self - Acrobat\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1051181,\"name\":\"Milena Mancini\",\"character\":\"Self - Dancer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fBB2Ng6c8Gf3pmJy6qQOT8Tyw8A.jpg\"},{\"id\":1685281,\"name\":\"Pia Driver\",\"character\":\"Self - Dancer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1685282,\"name\":\"Patti Hines\",\"character\":\"Self - Dancer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1004686,\"name\":\"Alec Mann\",\"character\":\"Self - Dancer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qfJMeq0pIRCiAOGuoG4iQqhb98p.jpg\"},{\"id\":1173241,\"name\":\"Jason Piper\",\"character\":\"Self - Dancer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hn2DT4XUeigmUqa7Kh4eKDKLm7S.jpg\"},{\"id\":1655800,\"name\":\"Adam Pudney\",\"character\":\"Self - Dancer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2097520,\"name\":\"Alicia Herrero Simon\",\"character\":\"Self - Dancer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1685284,\"name\":\"Emma Ribbing\",\"character\":\"Self - Dancer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1685285,\"name\":\"Andile E Sotiya\",\"character\":\"Self - Dancer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1685286,\"name\":\"Melanie Teall\",\"character\":\"Self - Dancer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1685287,\"name\":\"Rod Buchanan\",\"character\":\"Self - Dancer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ajjowhyRAw8DkltSKxL5A06clk.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":27,\"title\":\"9 Songs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/91O7z0vo7MiNWd5xD2BoivwbQsb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bybAHw5fenKXRFI4phanPhpljlT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt, a young glaciologist, soars across the vast, silent, icebound immensities of the South Pole as he recalls his love affair with Lisa. They meet at a mobbed rock concert in a vast music hall - London's Brixton Academy. They are in bed at night's end. Together, over a period of several months, they pursue a mutual sexual passion whose inevitable stages unfold in counterpoint to nine live-concert songs.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":446893,\"title\":\"Trolls World Tour\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7W0G3YECgDAfnuiHG91r8WqgIOe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qsxhnirlp7y4Ae9bd11oYJSX59j.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":332562,\"title\":\"A Star Is Born\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wrFpXMNBRj2PBiN4Z5kix51XaIZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dDYpjrwh1wNVQk0rEpc9P81wQt4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Seasoned musician Jackson Maine discovers — and falls in love with — struggling artist Ally. She has just about given up on her dream to make it big as a singer — until Jack coaxes her into the spotlight. But even as Ally's career takes off, the personal side of their relationship is breaking down, as Jack fights an ongoing battle with his own internal demons.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":69,\"title\":\"Walk the Line\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p8lPTjvjOjTfvC1E9pmMwcF9vkn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pMBKzEotLUzk3NuQiyVjZEDlH70.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A chronicle of country music legend Johnny Cash's life, from his early days on an Arkansas cotton farm to his rise to fame with Sun Records in Memphis, where he recorded alongside Elvis Presley, Jerry Lee Lewis and Carl Perkins.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1422562,\"title\":\"The Moment\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dYgCgTqqMnWdsnP2XirdcFB28ch.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lQUsfSUcai6ZOHQHgobSlF0IDUV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A rising pop sensation navigates fame and industry pressures while preparing for her arena tour debut, revealing the transformation of underground culture into mainstream success.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13576,\"title\":\"Michael Jackson's This Is It\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8GvQzHFSqr9KhyVxLEpB5dXPOWG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mqAuLsN6oOme6lSKoTb6yyP4U8E.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A compilation of interviews, rehearsals and backstage footage of Michael Jackson as he prepared for his series of sold-out shows in London.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1628123,\"title\":\"BTS THE COMEBACK LIVE | ARIRANG\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tztql23n2UCoM76KyCSKoZxVUL1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rI9VPEw13XlVZzhOcLXt3Tiweyx.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"BTS is back. The iconic group returns to the stage for a live reunion concert to perform legendary hits and unveil brand-new tracks.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":341012,\"title\":\"Popstar: Never Stop Never Stopping\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jBZeZZNjYBUU21zFvBnin5n62bv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nUUKoiMSRa82cxoltjhSpVNpFXO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When his new album fails to sell records, pop/rap superstar Conner4real goes into a major tailspin and watches his celebrity high life begin to collapse. He'll try anything to bounce back, anything except reuniting with his old rap group The Style Boyz.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1041513,\"title\":\"Encanto at the Hollywood Bowl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sa3Ku5yNVjp8NloWxJoI9dQjvOi.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xk8GTxGGDNMLDdho3XCNHJHYuDk.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Step into Casa Madrigal for a special concert spectacular as the original voice cast of Disney Animation's Oscar®-winning \\\"Encanto,\\\" Stephanie Beatriz, Adassa, Carolina Gaitán, Jessica Darrow, Diane Guerrero, Mauro Castillo, Angie Cepeda and Olga Merediz, along with special guests including Colombian superstar Carlos Vives, reunites for \\\"Encanto at the Hollywood Bowl.\\\" This unprecedented concert experience gives you a front-row seat to the musical extravaganza celebrating the global phenomenon.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12182,\"title\":\"Nick and Norah's Infinite Playlist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cndxWgZEHnSUtytrMjal97ye34E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q9m40JSqittqMWYQet2TCzVWSPO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Nick cannot stop obsessing over his ex-girlfriend, Tris, until Tris' friend Norah suddenly shows interest in him at a club. Thus begins an odd night filled with ups and downs as the two keep running into Tris and her new boyfriend while searching for Norah's drunken friend, Caroline, with help from Nick's band mates. As the night winds down, the two have to figure out what they want from each other.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":568332,\"title\":\"Taylor Swift: Reputation Stadium Tour\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/niMx0WNoKd55HxohjVnYAL7ySfw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4uMrZS7XEHRNKwHr5wSOxROanPF.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Taylor Swift takes the stage in Dallas for the Reputation Stadium Tour and celebrates a monumental night of music, memories and visual magic.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1093237,\"title\":\"Hurry Up Tomorrow\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9W44XSMYbjXdlXcQhD104zPhhhJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iqQSRP52a8q7CNViVyXz6nC5CJP.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A musician plagued by insomnia is pulled into an odyssey with a stranger who begins to unravel the very core of his existence.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"CFJaK3pbvXI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"uqMmRX83RqI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"K3wboINrizE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}